      "content": "hey so i tripped on the sidewalk earlier and kind of hit my head when i went down. im not bleeding or anything but im feeling kinda dizzy and the light from my phone is making my eyes feel weirdly sensitive. what can i do to fix the dizziness so i can finish my work shift??",
